    "chicken-zucchini-meatballs": {
      "id": "chicken-zucchini-meatballs",
      "title": "<a href=\"https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1021328-chicken-zucchini-meatballs-with-feta\">Chicken-Zucchini Meatballs With Feta</a> + orzo",
      "do": "Oven 425°. Slice 2 zucchini ½ inch; salt. Grate 3rd zucchini + ½ shallot into a bowl; add panko, cumin, ½ tsp salt; skip red-pepper flakes. Mix in ground chicken + chopped dill. Form 16 meatballs on oiled sheet; roast 10 min. Pat sliced zucchini dry; oil; add to sheet; bake 15–20 min. Boil orzo; butter + salt. Chop other ½ shallot; stir in lemon juice, salt, crumbled feta, ¼ cup olive oil. Spoon over meatballs.",
